('Semantic documents','Use meaningful elements, a document language, and an informative title. HTML describes structure; CSS supplies presentation.','<!doctype html>\n<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Notes</title></head>\n<body><main><h1>Notes</h1><p>Welcome, Rudy.</p></main></body></html>','<nav aria-label="Main"><a href="/">Home</a></nav>\n<article><h2>Recipe</h2><p>Warm cider.</p></article>'),
