('Headings and emphasis','Text mode stores ordinary Markdown. Most readers support headings, emphasis, code spans, and lists. The source remains directly editable.','# Meeting notes\n\n**Important** and *emphasized* text.\n\nUse `rudyedit` to begin.','## Actions\n- Check the recipe\n- Review the build\n\n1. Open a file\n2. Save your changes'),
